### Health Check
GET https://localhost:7000/webhooks/health

### Test Shipment Notification
POST https://localhost:7000/webhooks/test/shipment

### Test Invoice Notification
POST https://localhost:7000/webhooks/test/invoice

### Custom Shipment Webhook Test
POST https://localhost:7000/webhooks/ti/shipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "999888777",
  "wayBillNumber": "ASN999",
  "trackingNumber": "1Z999AA9999999999",
  "carrier": "UPS",
  "shipDate": "2024-08-15",
  "estimatedDelivery": "2024-08-17",
  "shipmentDetails": {
    "weight": "0.5 kg",
    "dimensions": "10x5x2 cm",
    "packages": 1
  }
}

### Custom Invoice Webhook Test
POST https://localhost:7000/webhooks/ti/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "999888777",
  "documentNumber": "INV-2024-999",
  "documentType": "INVOICE",
  "totalAmount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "issueDate": "2024-08-16",
  "dueDate": "2024-09-15",
  "pdfUrl": "https://example.com/invoice.pdf"
}
